    "caption": "Poster, 'there's a MAN'S job to be done', April 1940, Wellington, by New Zealand Army. Purchased 2007. Te Papa (GH015836)",
    "captionFormatted": "<a href=\"https://collections.tepapa.govt.nz/object/780948\">Poster, 'there's a MAN'S job to be done'</a>, April 1940, Wellington, by New Zealand Army. Purchased 2007. Te Papa (GH015836)",
    "collection": "History",
    "collectionLabel": "History",
    "creditLine": "Purchased 2007",
    "depicts": [
      {
